                  "type": "textComponent",
                  "text": "Principal Customer Success Lead - Italy in the EMEA Medtronic's Digital Technologies team within Surgical & Robotics division.\n\n• Leader of the Customer Success plans and activities in Italy.\n•  Creation of customer engagement initiatives, including workshops, educational programs, congresses, and hands-on events.\n• Project managed multiple full-cycle implementations of the Touch Surgery Ecosystem across major hospital systems in Italy.\n• Collaborate with Sales, local and global marketing, regional stakeholders, and country teams to ensure alignment, scalability, and growth.\n• Coordinated resources to enhance customer satisfaction and ensure timely project execution within budget.  \n• Engaged with clinical and administrative stakeholders, fostering effective communication throughout deployment projects.\n• Market analysis and business case development for pipeline products, product development, and new market opportunities. \n• Lead Kickoff and Training Presentations for clinical audiences and provide Go-Live support in the operating room. \n• Partner with the sales team and project manage and support pre-sales activities, including IT, privacy and cybersecurity reviews, leveraging Medtronic’s expert teams when required. \n• Monitor account health post Go-live and create action plans to increase adoption and prevent account risk.\n• Partner with local and global stakeholders to align on go-to-market and regional requirements."
